why Every Horde quest of the City of Dalaran in one run, lead-ins included.

# The City of Dalaran's Horde quests in one guide: Doctor Martin Felben in
# the Undercity, Magus Wordeen Voidglare's chain from Tarren Mill to the Image
# of Archmage Modera, one run through the dungeon, then the hand-ins. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The chain: Wordeen's 544 Prison Break In and 93680 Key to the City -> 545
# Dalaran Patrols -> 92434 Blood in the Streets (to Modera's image by the
# lake) -> Modera's 96984 Heart of Disruption (the Shade of the Archmage's
# Arcane Mote, back to Wordeen) -> 97287 Shrewd Negotiations (back to Modera).
# Melisara's 96986
# The Grave Knight (Atrexis) and Doctor Martin Felben's 96988 Source of Power
# (six Cracked Sentry Cores). Inside, Rexxie Copperclutch gives 96987
# Opportunistic Education (The Founding of Dalaran, from a Dalaran Tome).
#
# Left out: nothing of the Horde's. Modera's 92459 Friend of the Kirin Tor is the
# Alliance's only.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Rexxie or the tome inside,
# so their goals stand at the door (@8.8,59.6, Alterac Mountains, by the lake)
# with `group 5`. The steps follow a run of my own. Every quest goal is
# counted by the quest log, so a group that takes them in another order still
# gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - What drops where: players' recordings (data/codex/recorded.json): the
#   Cracked Sentry Cores from Fragmented Sentries and the Unstable Sentinel.
# - A run of my own on 2026-11-12 (Horde, five players, level 34), recorded
#   with Polestar's recorder and shared with Polestar Client: Rexxie's quest
#   taken first, then Atrexis, Lyn the Ignored, the Arcane Anomaly, the Fel
#   Ancient, the Mana Elemental, the Unstable Sentinel (the Sentry Cores from
#   the Fragmented Sentries on the way), the Shade of the Archmage, the tome,
#   the Mana Devourer, and Rexxie's hand-in.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   28 to 35).
# - The lead-ins need level 30, and their mobs are level 32 to 35
#   (data/forever), so the guide starts at 30 and those steps wait for 33.

